  "responsibility": "Says what a move would rewrite, or why it would be refused, holding and writing nothing",
  "description": "TASK-472.16, ADR 0051. Runs the move's own checks and rewrites against the two vaults as they are on disk, then answers the board, both ends and every drill-down it would rewrite, each as it would read. A writer is never kept waiting for a question, so the answer can be out of date by the time the move runs: the move checks everything again under its leases, and the version the preview read is the one the move states.",
